# Review-flow suites the CURRENT self-review pin is known not to pass (test/ci/self-review-pin.sh), one per line:
#   <suite file name> <the 40-char pin sha> <the protection that is not in the pinned snapshot yet>
# Allowed only for that exact pin: a pin bump runs every suite against the new pin again. Keep this list empty whenever
# the newest reviewed main carries the protection — bump the pin instead (docs/self-review.md).
dev-review-once.sh edb4fb32e98602b9ebe30cd85569bc1f77236739 each dev commit reviewed once (range from the last completed dev review of any verdict, main side excluded, coverage-gated landing) is on dev, not in the pin yet
dev-review-range.sh edb4fb32e98602b9ebe30cd85569bc1f77236739 the pin re-reviews a blocked commit's range and diffs main's side; the reviewed-once range is on dev, not in the pin yet
review-fix-of-nonancestor.sh edb4fb32e98602b9ebe30cd85569bc1f77236739 the pin's dev cover base goes back below an unrepaired block; the reviewed-once range is on dev, not in the pin yet
